#: ui/EmpathMessageMarkDialog.cpp:63
msgid ""
"Tagging messages is for your own\n"
"benefit. You can use this to simply\n"
"remember which messages you are interested\n"
"in; you can select 'tagged messages' for\n"
"some operations."
